   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Ten groups reading the same partition read the SAME BYTES. Nothing is copied per subscriber -\neach group costs one integer. Replay is 'set your offset backwards'; retention is free because\nreading never destroys.",
